@startuml
title S6  Add missing ingredients and manage shopping  US-10 / US-11
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor #172A3A
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam ArrowColor #345A72
skinparam Shadowing false
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam TitleFontColor #123A52
skinparam TitleFontSize 19
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor #EDF5FA
skinparam ClassBorderColor #456F89
skinparam ComponentBackgroundColor #EDF5FA
skinparam ComponentBorderColor #456F89
skinparam PackageBorderColor #456F89
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #E6F4F0
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #417364
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #EDF5FA
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #617C8D
hide footbox
autonumber
actor User
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "Protected routes" as API
participant ShoppingService as Shopping
database "Owned data\nrepositories" as Store
User -> UI : add missing, list, add manually or delete
UI -> API : shopping action with bearer token
ref over API : S8: verified owner
alt POST /recipes/:id/shopping-items
  API -> Shopping : addMissing(owner, recipeId)
  group single transaction
    Shopping -> Store : findOwned(owner, recipeId)
    alt missing or foreign recipe
      Store --> Shopping : no owned row
      Shopping --> API : unavailable
      API --> UI : 404; no write
    else owned recipe
      Shopping -> Store : listByOwner(owner) for inventory
      Store --> Shopping : current inventory names
      Shopping -> Shopping : normalize and subtract names
      Shopping -> Store : upsertNames(owner, missing)
      Store --> Shopping : committed list; preserve existing IDs
      Shopping --> API : list
      API --> UI : 200 resulting shopping list
    end
  end
else GET /shopping-items
  API -> Shopping : list(owner)
  Shopping -> Store : listByOwner(owner) for shopping
  Shopping --> API : owned items or []
  API --> UI : 200 list
else POST /shopping-items
  API -> Shopping : add(owner, name)
  alt blank name
    Shopping --> API : invalid name; no write
    API --> UI : 400
  else nonblank name
    Shopping -> Store : upsertNames(owner, [name])
    Store --> Shopping : new or existing item
    Shopping --> API : item and insertion outcome
    API --> UI : 201 new; 200 existing
  end
else DELETE /shopping-items/:id
  API -> Shopping : remove(owner, entryId)
  Shopping -> Store : deleteOwned(owner, entryId)
  Shopping --> API : removed or unavailable
  API --> UI : 204 if removed; otherwise 404
end
@enduml
